<!--
  Copy is written for one reader: a Bingwa Sokoni agent running their business
  off this phone. Two rules throughout:

  1. Say what happened and what to do about it. "Send failed" is banned by
     network/README.md for the same reason "Error 3" would be.
  2. No jargon the agent didn't choose. They know "bundle", "sender ID" and
     "M-Pesa"; they do not know "unmatched flow", "enqueue" or "gateway 429".
-->
